&lt;h2 id="natural-nail-care-a-routine-for-healthy-glow"&gt;Natural Nail Care: A Routine for Healthy Glow&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;She noticed her hands first thing at the cafe—fingers wrapped around a warm mug, nails catching the soft winter light. No glossy gel, no artful decals. Just a subtle sheen, a hint of pink, a tidy shape. It felt oddly grounding, like slipping into a favorite sweater or clearing the kitchen counter before starting dinner. There’s a quiet luxury in natural nail care—no dramatic reveal needed, only the contentment of hands that look loved.&lt;/p&gt;</description><media:group><media:content url="https://blog.nailak.com/images/brand/26.webp" medium="image"/><media:thumbnail url="https://blog.nailak.com/images/brand/26.webp"/><media:content url="https://blog.nailak.com/posts/2025/11/07/survey-says...-february-28th-2024-natural-nail-care-routine/cards/facebook/survey-says-february-28th-2024-natural-nail-care-routine-cuticle-oil-benefits.jpg" medium="image"/><media:thumbnail url="https://blog.nailak.com/posts/2025/11/07/survey-says...-february-28th-2024-natural-nail-care-routine/cards/facebook/survey-says-february-28th-2024-natural-nail-care-routine-cuticle-oil-benefits.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://blog.nailak.com/posts/2025/11/07/survey-says...-february-28th-2024-natural-nail-care-routine/cards/facebook/survey-says-february-28th-2024-natural-nail-care-routine-cuticle-oil-benefits.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://blog.nailak.com/posts/2025/11/07/survey-says...-february-28th-2024-natural-nail-care-routine/cards/instagram/survey-says-february-28th-2024-natural-nail-care-routine-cuticle-oil-benefits.jpg" medium="image"/><media:thumbnail url="https://blog.nailak.com/posts/2025/11/07/survey-says...-february-28th-2024-natural-nail-care-routine/cards/instagram/survey-says-february-28th-2024-natural-nail-care-routine-cuticle-oil-benefits.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://blog.nailak.com/posts/2025/11/07/survey-says...-february-28th-2024-natural-nail-care-routine/cards/instagram/survey-says-february-28th-2024-natural-nail-care-routine-cuticle-oil-benefits.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://blog.nailak.com/posts/2025/11/07/survey-says...-february-28th-2024-natural-nail-care-routine/cards/pinterest/survey-says-february-28th-2024-natural-nail-care-routine-cuticle-oil-benefits.jpg" medium="image"/><media:thumbnail url="https://blog.nailak.com/posts/2025/11/07/survey-says...-february-28th-2024-natural-nail-care-routine/cards/pinterest/survey-says-february-28th-2024-natural-nail-care-routine-cuticle-oil-benefits.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://blog.nailak.com/posts/2025/11/07/survey-says...-february-28th-2024-natural-nail-care-routine/cards/pinterest/survey-says-february-28th-2024-natural-nail-care-routine-cuticle-oil-benefits.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/></media:group></item><item><title>This TikTok Viral Bodycare Brand Lives Up to the Hype — How to use cuticle oil properly</title><link>https://blog.nailak.com/posts/2025/10/19/this-tiktok-viral-bodycare-brand-lives-up-to-the-hype-how-to-use-cuticle-oil-properly/</link><pubDate>Sun, 19 Oct 2025 23:51:47 +0000</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://blog.nailak.com/posts/2025/10/19/this-tiktok-viral-bodycare-brand-lives-up-to-the-hype-how-to-use-cuticle-oil-properly/</guid><description>
